    "title": "📅 Townwide family campout & movie night on Sept. 26 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "21 hours ago 📅 Townwide Campout & Outdoor Movie for Youth Appreciation Week\nAll Livingston families are invited to a townwide campout and movie night on Saturday, September 26, 2026 on Robert H. Harp Drive, Livingston, NJ 07039 .\nEvening schedule:\nTent setup: 4:30 – 5:30 p.m. Kids’ games & activities: 5:30 – 6:30 p.m. Dinner break: 6:00 – 7:00 p.m. Movie under the stars: ELIO to end the night The evening’s events will be led by Scout Troops 12 & 16 and Cub Scout Pack 16 .\nRegistration: Pre-register online through Community Pass or in person at the Recreation Office, 204 Hillside Avenue, Livingston, NJ 07039 .\nPre-registration is open through Friday, September 25 at 12 noon .\nMore Info: Calendar • Townwide Campout & Movie: Youth Appreci...\nThis article includes content summarized and organized with AI tools, which can make mistakes. Learn more.",
    "summary": "21 hours ago 📅 Townwide Campout & Outdoor Movie for Youth Appreciation Week All Livingston families are invited to a townwide campout and movie night on Saturday, September 26, 2026 on Robert H. Harp Drive, Livingston, NJ 07039 . Tent setup: 4:30 – 5:30 p.m. Kids’ games & activities: 5:30 – 6:30 p.m. Dinner break: 6:00 – 7:00 p.m. Movie under the stars: ELIO to end the night The evening’s events will be led by Scout Troops 12 & 16 and Cub Scout Pack 16 .",
